Another iteration of this, after 542d914d3a056bf3a866ad7167f98083cd7018d1. I am also including the result of

goodrich@CYBERPOWERPC:/opt/stan/src/stan$ find . -name '*_iwyu.txt' -print0 | xargs -0 wc -l | sort -g -r > /tmp/iwyu_sorted.txt

which sorts the foo.hpp_iwyu.txt files by descending order of line count, which loosely corresponds to how much iwyu thinks should be changed but can be inflated by warnings and whatnot.

