From: u2a7f346506a3e9ff at groups.google.com (Marcus Brubaker)
Date: Mon, 06 May 2013 18:12:54 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Optimizing chain()
Message-ID: <nhHokB6kM9Q.pkkWMcKfr_UJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <nhHokB6kM9Q.VeuGlVzF6AgJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <nhHokB6kM9Q.QOw8GFfY_BgJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <nhHokB6kM9Q.VeuGlVzF6AgJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
