user    0m16.047s
sys     0m0.225s

but the RAM peaked at 5% for the modified version compared to 5.3% for the current version (of 8GB I think, i.e. excluding the swap). So, that is not huge savings, but I'm sure it would be a bit more if we actually narrowed the #includes from Eigen and did a multivariate or otherwise big model.

