From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Tue, 21 May 2013 21:05:33 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Dense Metropolis (and potentially diag metro) not working
Message-ID: <T6kf0-N1Eno.49R3MzW7d7sJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <T6kf0-N1Eno.RfH1AzB33uMJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <T6kf0-N1Eno.CiGpPdSbjBoJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <T6kf0-N1Eno.RfH1AzB33uMJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
