That probably means you have something inverted or
there's something going wrong with the estimation.
It should take many fewer iterations.  Just test on

    * diagonal:  bivariate normal with varying scales and
                 zero correlation

    * full:  bivariate normal with non-zero correlation,
             with and without varying scales

- Bob

