> I could include them together with log1m_exp and log_diff_exp in the next commit removing the reference of those five
> functions.

Do they also get used with var or fvar types or are
there specializations for both types in the agrad
namespace?

If they can be further optimized, we can do all of
that in a separate round of commits and a single pull
request.  (Thanks for bearing with us sorting out our
process.)

We need to do a more thorough review of all the code
for this kind of thing.

- Bob

